# Project Guidelines

Before any code change, read [docs/agents/core/pre-processing.md](../../docs/agents/core/pre-processing.md).

Full routing: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/agents/INDEX.md](../../docs/agents/INDEX.md).

## Quick rules

**Backend:** `BaseController`; no `[Authorize]` — `GetCurrentSession()` per endpoint. `[Table("name")]` without `Schema=`. `HasDefaultSchema()` in DbContext. Navigation properties on all FKs.

**Blazor:** `SecurePageBase`; `OnPageInitializedAsync()` not `OnInitializedAsync()`. `ApiService`, `SessionStateService`, `NavigationManager` only.

**Config:** No hardcoded URLs or schema names. `ApiSettings:BaseUrl`, `DatabaseSettings:SchemaName`.

**Audit fields:** ATH uses `created_user`/`CreatedUser`; Assistants uses `user_id`/`UserId` for creator — see [docs/agents/reference/audit-fields.md](../../docs/agents/reference/audit-fields.md).

